       "endDate": {
        "month": 3,
        "year": 2020
       }
      },
      "totalDuration": "2 yrs 9 mos",
      "description": "Managed a small engineering team of 4 engineers and reported directly to the CEO. \nTeam was designed to be a startup-within-a-startup and follow the core principles of a lean startup. \nProjects would had short delivery times and quick iteration cycles.\nSome of the projects included:\n- Goody Box Service: a tailored experience where customers would receive a box full of products picked out by professional stylists\n- Remade: a clothing line and resale experience specifically designed for resale\n- ThredUp Luxe: a VIP consignment experience for designer brands",
      "insights": ""
